WEEK–4 — Kafka Producer & Consumer in Java
Aim

To write a simple Java program to:

Create a Kafka topic
Create a Kafka producer
Send a message to a topic
Create a Kafka consumer
Receive the message

The PDF uses a single-broker Kafka cluster with Docker Compose and the plain Kafka Java Client API.

